{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616970/extras/c885d80a203ffde9e0547545e3671beb.avif?t=1770776925\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sakuragi Asuka is an ordinary girl of no particular note. She's so plain and ordinary her parents think nothing of palming her off on her aunt for a year so they can work overseas, leaving Asuka marooned on the small island of Omorishima.<br><br>Asuka is an awkward girl by nature, and she finds it hard to fit in. How in the world is she going to cope living in Omorishima, which is so dissimilar to Tokyo?! <br><br>Asuka is dreading going to school, and she's terrified she won't be able to make any friends... <br><br>But a chance encounter with a mysterious maiden late at night soon flips Asuka's life upside-down. This maiden has long, fair hair, bright blue eyes...<br><br>And she also has a tail!<br><br>What is Asuka going to do now?!<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616970/extras/ce3f39e63782d72686e4cf161d640115.avif?t=1770776925\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- About 120,000 words of text (approx 6-10 hours of reading)  <br>- Choices which determine your ending  <br>- Two adorable heroines, Misuzu and Nerine  <br>- Cute anime-style artwork  <br>- A custom OST  <br>- One cute mermaid girl!<br>- A poly ending!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You are my sunshine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3616970/03685087312535ebaa001a1a9fe320e35beee654.jpg"},{"name":"Easy breezy","path":"https://cdn.a